			"notes": "- Extended stats view\n- Add support for Hypixel API\n- Skywars, BuildBattle, Duels, TNT Run stats, please create a PR for other modes!\n- Hitbox & Nametag colouring (Vanilla F3+B & PolyHitbox support)\n- Show denicked stats in tab\n- Auto Updater notice\n- Permanent Replays\n- Extended Seraph support (Client & Ping)\n- Add Luna API for Ping\n- Add Name History\n- Add /status command\n- Show Hidden Winstreaks\n- Add support to show rank in tab stats\n- Double tap to toggle tabstats\n- Deprecate Polsu and Coral\n- Move to Hypixel Mod API, create gamestate manager\n- Restructure code to have modular type\n- Lots of other small changes & bug fixes\n\nThank you @Ilovemuffins97 for lots help in adding new features (lunar, status command, hidden winstreaks, client tags and much much more)"
		},
